-- The decorator probe for the walkthrough's last step.  On the stable build the "@" is a lexer error and stops the
-- whole file, which is why it is on its own.  On the unstable dev and shelf builds it is a warning and is ignored.
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
TIMEZONE IS "Asia/Singapore"

@effective 2011-01-01
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rate` MEANS 7
